  "Deal Bless damage to 1 foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color> of Minami's Max HP, grant all allies $2 <link\\=\"s|111\"><u>Blessing</u></link> stack.\\nGrant Minami $3 <link\\=\"s|169\"><u>Nectar</u></link> stack.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>The fragrance of the lily spreads out in a radiant glow, gently caressing your allies and dealing Bless damage to foes.</color></size></b>": "",
  "Restore HP equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color> of Minami's Max HP + <color\\=#FFFC40>$2</color> to the selected ally and the ally with the lowest current HP, and cure $3 debuffs. Grant $4 <link\\=\"s|111\"><u>Blessing</u></link> stack to allies healed, at the start of their turn, restore their HP equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$5</color> of Minami's max HP + <color\\=#FFFC40>$6</color>. Lasts for $7 turns.\\nGrant Minami $8 <link\\=\"s|169\"><u>Nectar</u></link> stack.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>The light gradually spreads out, turning into a golden pillar of light that embraces your allies, the pain melts away as if the wound were being stroked by soft hands.</color></size></b>": "",
  "Spend all <link\\=\"s|169\"><u>Nectar</u></link> stacks, immediately restore HP to selected ally equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color> of Minami's Max HP + <color\\=#FFFC40>$2</color>. Also restore HP to the ally with the lowest current HP with this effect $3 times. For each <link\\=\"s|169\"><u>Nectar</u></link> stack, activate this effect $5 more time. For each <link\\=\"s|169\"><u>Nectar</u></link> stack spent, increase the Max HP of other Thieves by <color\\=#FFFC40>$7</color> of Minami's Max HP (up to <color\\=#FFFC40>$8</color> Max HP). Lasts for $9 turns.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>Crystalline tears slowly drip down, the vibrant green coloring the yellowed grass and trees, disease and pain quietly leave, injecting the battlefield with the vitality of life.</color></size></b>": "",
  "[HIGHLIGHT]: Immediately restore all allies' HP equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color> of Minami's Max HP + <color\\=#FFFC40>$2</color> and cure $3 debuff. Increase targets' Max HP by <color\\=#FFFC40>$4</color> of Minami's Max HP (up to <color\\=#FFFC40>$5</color> Max HP). Lasts for $6 turns. After their action, restore their HP equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$7</color> of Minami's Max HP + <color\\=#FFFC40>$8</color>. Lasts for $9 turn.\\n[ONE MORE]: Deal Bless damage to 1 foe.\\nMelee Attack: Uses a melee weapon to deal light Phys damage to 1 foe. \\nGun Attack: Deal Gun damage to 1 foe. Can fire until out of ammo.": "",
  "After Minami heals an ally, increase their DMG Dealt by <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color> + <color\\=#FFFC40>$2</color> * <link\\=\"s|111\"><u>Blessing</u></link> stack for $4 turn (up to <color\\=#FFFC40>$3</color> DMG Dealt).": "",
  "After Minami heals an ally, increase their DMG Dealt by <color\\=#0169ca>$1</color> + <color\\=#0169ca>$2</color> * <link\\=\"s|111\"><u>Blessing</u></link> stack for $4 turn (up to <color\\=#0169ca>$3</color> DMG Dealt).": "",
