  "When an ally is below $1 HP, immediately restore their HP equal to <color\\=#0169ca>$2</color> of Minami's Max HP + <color\\=#0169ca>$3</color>. Cooldown Time: $4 turns.\\nAllies healed by Minami permanently increase DMG Bonus by <color\\=#0169ca>$5</color> and Crit DMG by <color\\=#0169ca>$6</color>. If they are a Bless character, increase this to <color\\=#0169ca>$7</color> DMG Bonus and <color\\=#0169ca>$8</color> Crit DMG.": "",
